ass=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738170/extras/6eb3edb04dc962ec1afa8777e42857c5.poster.avif?t=1781599373\" width=780 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738170/extras/6eb3edb04dc962ec1afa8777e42857c5.webm?t=1781599373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738170/extras/6eb3edb04dc962ec1afa8777e42857c5.mp4?t=1781599373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A gripping epic with no fillers –</strong> Experience an original narrative where every quest matters, adding new depth to the story, the characters or their relationships.<br></li><li><strong>Dive into an emotional journey –</strong> Travel across a continent inhabited by nomadic civilizations forced to migrate to escape the Corrosion, and connect with those who have chosen to await death while celebrating life.</li></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738170/extras/01df51a2c4b011914b8df39148bd5e9e.webp?t=1781599373\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738170/extras/c383ff057bd6a6a3dfee0ec635b30d87.poster.avif?t=1781599373\" width=780 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738170/extras/c383ff057bd6a6a3dfee0ec635b30d87.webm?t=1781599373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738170/extras/c383ff057bd6a6a3dfee0ec635b30d87.mp4?t=1781599373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are exploring the vast expanses of the continent of Avaris or battling relentless Corroded foes, enjoy a dynamic and adaptive soundtrack composed by Cédric Menendez. Carried by the enchanting voice of Emi Evans, known for her work on NieR:Automata™, your journey culminates with a final theme composed by Yasunori Mitsuda, famed for his work on games such as Chrono Trigger®, Xenoblade Chronicles™ and Sea of Stars.</p>", "short_description": "The population of Avaris is ravaged by the Corrosion, a terrible affliction that mutates all it infects into grotesque abominations. Play as Eline, a young nomad, and lead fierce battles alongside your allies to save the world from extinction.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Another French studio's take on the JRPG genre!”<br>PCGamesN<br><br>“Combat is bold and over-the-top.”<br>Gaming Boulevard<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738170/0282b90dab25408b4bc762148658a8244e275cf0/header.jpg?t=1781599373", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738170/e81dac398b835f9fdd7222ded0a240fa6deb768c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781599373", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738170/e81dac398b835f9fdd7222ded0a240fa6deb768c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781599373", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 - 11<br></li><